	quest.7FCA9352AF05C235.quest_desc: ["ท่อเหล่านี้ &6ทำให้อัตโนมัติ&r บางกระบวนการ:", "", "ส่ง &6Power&r: ", "- ทำงานเหมือน &bPower Pipe&r อื่น ๆ", "", "ส่ง &dMatter&r: ", "- จาก &bDisintegrator&r ไปยัง &bMatter Tanks&r ", "", "- จาก &dMatter Tanks&r ไปยัง &bmachines&r อื่นที่ต้องการ"]
	quest.7FCA9352AF05C235.quest_subtitle: "ท่อ Matter ช่วยให้เชื่อมต่อเครื่อง &aReplication&r ได้"
	quest.7FD0A63CDC267251.quest_desc: ["&bFrontier Spawner Upgrade Rune&f ปรับปรุงค่าการเกิดพื้นฐานของ spawner", "", "ใช้ดัน spawner ของคุณให้เกินขีดจำกัดของ vanilla"]
	quest.7FD0A63CDC267251.quest_subtitle: "การอัปเกรด spawner ระดับแรก"
	quest.7FD0A63CDC267251.title: "Frontier Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.7FD2368444636E93.quest_desc: ["Blacksmith &6อัปเกรด&r &boccult familiars&r ตัวอื่นได้", "", "และยัง &6ซ่อม&r &bอุปกรณ์&r ของคุณขณะที่คุณขุดหินด้วย"]
	quest.7FD2368444636E93.quest_subtitle: "เสริมพลัง"
	quest.7FD5FCEFE3697A7C.quest_desc: ["ด้วยพลังงานเพียง &e8EU/t&r เล็กน้อยเอง&r &bSteam Farmer&r ทำสิ่งต่อไปนี้ได้:", "- &6Tilling&r: เมื่อเปิดใช้ บล็อกดินจะกลายเป็นดินไถ แต่จะไม่ทำงานถ้าไม่มีน้ำ", "- &6Hydrating&r: เมื่อมีน้ำ ดินที่ไถแล้วจะชุ่มชื้น", "- &6Harvesting&r: เมื่อมีที่ว่างสำหรับผลผลิตเพียงพอ จะเก็บเกี่ยวพืชผลและต้นไม้ที่โตเต็มที่", "- &6Plating&r: เมื่อมีพืชผลหรือต้นกล้า จะปลูกลงบนดินที่ใช้ได้ โหมด plating ที่ต่างกันจะปลูกในรูปแบบที่ต่างกัน"]
	quest.7FD5FCEFE3697A7C.quest_subtitle: "ลูกข้าวโพด &ecorn&r พูดอะไรกับแม่ข้าวโพด &ecorn&r?"
	quest.7FEBDFAE021B3C56.quest_desc: ["มีประโยชน์กับการคราฟต์ที่ ใหญ่มาก ๆ&r"]
	quest.7FEBDFAE021B3C56.title: "Mega Crafting Storage"
	quest.7FF0A973396E9236.title: "hidden/status_effects/fatal_slumber"
	quest.83E3E680A82352AE.quest_desc: ["The endgame library can store vastly more powerful enchanted books. Build it once your enchanting setup can meet the highest requirements."]
	quest.83E3E680A82352AE.quest_subtitle: "The final library"
	quest.83E3E680A82352AE.title: "Ender Library"
	quest.85A619B9D50AD2E1.quest_desc: ["The strongest Sculkshelf variants demand the Deep Dark's rarest materials. &9Soul-Touched Sculkshelves&r are essential for the final enchanting setups."]
	quest.85A619B9D50AD2E1.quest_subtitle: "The deepest shelf"
	quest.85A619B9D50AD2E1.title: "Soul-Touched Sculkshelves"
	quest.88A62C4CD6184F4C.quest_desc: ["Collect the Deep Dark and End shelves that push enchanting into the late game, from Dormant Deepshelves through the specialized Deepshelf and Sculkshelf variants and finally the End shelves."]
	quest.88A62C4CD6184F4C.quest_subtitle: "Reach the highest tiers"
	quest.88A62C4CD6184F4C.title: "Deep & End Shelves"
	quest.8C1F828B31B54F68.quest_desc: ["Weapon and Bow Tomes restrict enchanting to the relevant combat enchantments, making it easier to build focused gear."]
	quest.8C1F828B31B54F68.quest_subtitle: "Target your combat enchants"
	quest.8C1F828B31B54F68.title: "Tomes of Combat"
	quest.9906694CDC25DA55.quest_desc: ["Take the Seashelf path even further with &bHeart Seashelves&r. These provide a powerful boost for Arcana-focused enchanting."]
	quest.9906694CDC25DA55.quest_subtitle: "Follow your heart"
	quest.9906694CDC25DA55.title: "Heart Seashelves"
	quest.9BFCAE52421B47DE.quest_desc: ["Upgrade to the Library of Alexandria for a much larger enchantment storage capacity and easier searching, storing and extracting."]
	quest.9BFCAE52421B47DE.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate storage"
	quest.9BFCAE52421B47DE.title: "Library of Alexandria"
	quest.9D8487E98AEEFDA4.quest_desc: ["Bring some Nether power into your enchanting setup. &4Blazing Hellshelves&r push the Hellshelf path further and provide stronger enchanting stats."]
	quest.9D8487E98AEEFDA4.quest_subtitle: "Burn brighter"
	quest.9D8487E98AEEFDA4.title: "Blazing Hellshelves"
	quest.9E9DC6728D304D10.quest_desc: ["The Enchantment Library stores enchantments as level-one-equivalent points, letting you build a reusable collection instead of keeping every enchanted book."]
	quest.9E9DC6728D304D10.quest_subtitle: "Store your enchantments"
	quest.9E9DC6728D304D10.title: "The Enchantment Library"
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60101.quest_desc: ["Collect the core shelves used to build your enchanting setup, from the Basic Bookshelf through Hellshelves, Seashelves, Infused variants, and their advanced Hell and Sea upgrades."]
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60101.quest_subtitle: "Master the first enchanting shelves"
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60101.title: "Core Shelf Collection"
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60202.quest_desc: ["Collect the Deep-Dark and End shelves that carry enchanting progression from the Deep tier into the final End tier."]
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60202.quest_subtitle: "Descend into the final tiers"
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60202.title: "Deep & End Shelves"
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60303.quest_desc: ["Collect the specialized shelves for tuning your enchanting stats and controlling what the table reveals, including Sight, Filtration, Treasure, Stability, and alternate stat shelves."]
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60303.quest_subtitle: "Fine-tune your enchanting setup"
	quest.A1B2C3D4E5F60303.title: "Specialized Shelves"
	quest.AA46DA6273BC417E.quest_desc: ["The upgraded scrapping tome pulls all enchantments from the item, but still destroys the original item."]
	quest.AA46DA6273BC417E.quest_subtitle: "Recover everything"
	quest.AA46DA6273BC417E.title: "Superior Scrapping"
	quest.AEC0FF7742D55E2A.quest_desc: ["Awaken the &9Dormant Deepshelves&r to create &9Deepshelves&r. This raises the ceiling of your enchanting setup considerably."]
	quest.AEC0FF7742D55E2A.quest_subtitle: "Wake the shelves"
	quest.AEC0FF7742D55E2A.title: "Deepshelves"
	quest.B35364D2CDE34D79.quest_desc: ["The Library of Alexandria is the upgraded library with a much larger storage capacity. Search, store and extract enchantments without filling your storage system with enchanted books."]
	quest.B35364D2CDE34D79.quest_subtitle: "Ultimate storage"
	quest.B35364D2CDE34D79.title: "Library of Alexandria"
	quest.B429990E9F924B2B.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Scrapping removes enchantments from an item, but the process is lossy and the original item is destroyed."]
	quest.B429990E9F924B2B.quest_subtitle: "Recover what you can"
	quest.B429990E9F924B2B.title: "Tome of Scrapping"
	quest.B5AAA6C5E2E6480F.quest_desc: ["Collect the specialized shelves that modify or focus enchanting behavior, including Sight, Aquatic Filtration, Arcane Treasures, Stability, and alternative stat shelves."]
	quest.B5AAA6C5E2E6480F.quest_subtitle: "Tune your enchanting setup"
	quest.B5AAA6C5E2E6480F.title: "Specialized Shelves"
	quest.B7985847833E9B2B.quest_desc: ["Store your enchanted books in the &5Enchantment Library&r and build up a reusable collection of enchantments instead of constantly gambling at the table."]
	quest.B7985847833E9B2B.quest_subtitle: "Never lose an enchantment again"
	quest.B7985847833E9B2B.title: "Enchantment Library"
	quest.C48C52C5D7F50AD0.quest_desc: ["With enough enchanting power, &4Hellshelves&r can be &dInfused&r into &4Infused Hellshelves&r. These are required for the next stage of progression."]
	quest.C48C52C5D7F50AD0.quest_subtitle: "Power through infusion"
	quest.C48C52C5D7F50AD0.title: "Infused Hellshelves"
	quest.C718F7F4300A189B.quest_desc: ["&6Sightshelves&r improve the enchanting table's ability to offer useful enchantments. They are an important part of a specialized enchanting setup."]
	quest.C718F7F4300A189B.quest_subtitle: "Better enchanting rolls"
	quest.C718F7F4300A189B.title: "Sightshelves"
	quest.CC1AF2381D604D0D.quest_desc: ["Craft the Apothic Enchanting Table and step into a redesigned enchanting system. The table uses three primary stats: Eterna, Quanta and Arcana, and can reach up to level 100."]
	quest.CC1AF2381D604D0D.quest_subtitle: "Begin the overhaul"
	quest.CC1AF2381D604D0D.title: "The Secrets of Enchanting"
	quest.CEC7743FCDAA58F8.quest_desc: ["Infuse your Deepshelves with the power of the &9Echo Shard&r to create &9Echoing Deepshelves&r and dramatically increase Arcana."]
	quest.CEC7743FCDAA58F8.quest_subtitle: "Echoes from below"
	quest.CEC7743FCDAA58F8.title: "Echoing Deepshelves"
	quest.D3F42AB6E92F4F2B.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Extraction retrieves all enchantments while leaving the original item intact. This is the safest way to strip valuable enchantments."]
	quest.D3F42AB6E92F4F2B.quest_subtitle: "Perfect extraction"
	quest.D3F42AB6E92F4F2B.title: "Tome of Extraction"
	quest.DC60C99CC44B0A51.quest_desc: ["Combine End materials with an &dEndshelf&r to create the &dPearlescent Endshelf&r, pushing your enchanting setup even further."]
	quest.DC60C99CC44B0A51.quest_subtitle: "Pearlescent perfection"
	quest.DC60C99CC44B0A51.title: "Pearlescent Endshelf"
	quest.E32566974C65FFB9.quest_desc: ["Upgrade your &6Sightshelves&r into their stronger form for even more control over your enchanting rolls."]
	quest.E32566974C65FFB9.quest_subtitle: "More control, more power"
	quest.E32566974C65FFB9.title: "Greater Sightshelves"
	quest.E4A33D19B6E660FC.quest_desc: ["&4Hellshelves&r are your first step into stronger enchanting. They provide &cQuanta&r and &aEterna&r, letting you push the enchanting table beyond vanilla limits."]
	quest.E4A33D19B6E660FC.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to the Nether path"
	quest.E4A33D19B6E660FC.title: "Hellshelves"
	quest.E9C84862D3889B37.quest_desc: ["Start your journey into &5Apothic Enchanting&r. The upgraded enchanting system expands vanilla enchanting with new shelves, three enchanting stats, infusion, and powerful tools."]
	quest.E9C84862D3889B37.quest_subtitle: "Enchanting is about to get serious"
	quest.E9C84862D3889B37.title: "Enchanting Reforged"
	quest.E9DB0716190C5F56.quest_desc: ["Infusing &bSeashelves&r unlocks a stronger version with improved enchanting stats. This is the sea-side route into advanced enchanting."]
	quest.E9DB0716190C5F56.quest_subtitle: "Power through infusion"
	quest.E9DB0716190C5F56.title: "Infused Seashelves"
	quest.EF7059E8DA084305.quest_desc: ["The Tome of Extraction removes enchantments while preserving the original item, making it the preferred option when you want to keep valuable gear intact."]
	quest.EF7059E8DA084305.quest_subtitle: "Perfect extraction"
	quest.EF7059E8DA084305.title: "Tome of Extraction"
	quest.F2F097789CBF49CE.quest_desc: ["The Enchantment Library stores enchanted books as points, measured in level-one equivalents. Insert higher-level enchantments once to unlock those levels for extraction later."]
	quest.F2F097789CBF49CE.quest_subtitle: "Store your enchantments"
	quest.F2F097789CBF49CE.title: "The Enchantment Library"
